---
import BuySection from './BuySection.astro';
---
<div id="dim-past" class="page">
  <div class="past-storm" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="past-hero">
    <canvas id="past-canvas"></canvas>
    <canvas id="tesla-arc" class="tesla-arc" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="past-hero-text">
      <div class="era-tag rv">3 · Past · Wardenclyffe Tower · 1893</div>
      <h1 class="past-h1 rv d1">Step into<br>Tesla's <em>laboratory</em>.<br>1893.</h1>
      <p class="past-lead rv d2">The air cracks with ozone. Bolts of man-made lightning fill the room while he sits, calm, reading — a tower that should not exist, transmitting free energy through the Earth itself.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ticker amber"><div class="ttrack"><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span></div></div>
  <div class="past-content">
    <p class="grid-eyebrow rv">The tower that would power the world · 3 · 6 · 9</p>
    <div class="past-grid three">
      <div class="pc rv"><p class="pc-yr">3 · 1905 · The Patent</p><h3 class="pc-h">Energy through the <em>Earth itself</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">The whole planet, pole to pole, as one generator. Limitless energy — no fuel, no wires.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d1"><p class="pc-yr">6 · The World System</p><h3 class="pc-h">Free power. Every home. <em>No wires</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">A ring of towers feeding every point on Earth — light, heat, power. Free of cost.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d2"><p class="pc-yr">9 · The Pyramid · 3·6·9</p><h3 class="pc-h">A triangle that <em>powers a planet</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">A triangle — the electromagnetic pyramid that became Wardenclyffe. The same 3·6·9 the signal runs on today.</p></div>
    </div>
    <section class="prometheus rv">
      <div class="prom-img"><img src="/illustrations/torch-v2.jpg" alt="Tesla as Prometheus, carrying the fire he meant to give away" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.prometheus').remove()"></div>
      <div class="prom-text">
        <p class="prom-eyebrow">Prometheus · The Fire-Bringer</p>
        <h3 class="prom-h">He stole fire<br>from the <em>gods</em>.</h3>
        <p class="prom-p">Prometheus gave humanity fire. Tesla gave it free energy. Both punished for the same crime — handing power to the people instead of selling it back. ⚡ZAPP carries the torch on-chain, where no one can take it back.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="past-archive rv">
      <p class="grid-eyebrow">The Archive · 1899 – 1911 · Recovered</p>
      <div class="archive-grid">
        <figure class="arch"><img src="/illustrations/tesla-lab-1899.jpg" alt="Tesla in his Colorado Springs laboratory, 1899 — bathed in man-made lightning" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.arch').remove()"><figcaption>Colorado Springs, 1899 — he sat and read while the air itself burned.</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="arch"><img src="/illustrations/wardenclyffe.jpg" alt="Wardenclyffe Tower standing on Long Island" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.arch').remove()"><figcaption>Wardenclyffe Tower — the antenna built to power the world for free.</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="arch"><img src="/illustrations/tesla-tower-news.jpg" alt="Newspaper feature: Tesla's Tower" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.arch').remove()"><figcaption>"…draw millions of volts… feed it out to cities, factories and homes — <em>without wires</em>."</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="arch"><img src="/illustrations/world-system.jpg" alt="Tesla's Wireless World System, New York American, 1911" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.arch').remove()"><figcaption>The "World System," 1911 — to turn the Earth into one gigantic dynamo.</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>
    <figure class="tribute-altar rv">
      <p class="altar-eyebrow">A Tribute</p>
      <div class="altar-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="altar-frame">
        <img src="/illustrations/tribute.jpg" alt="A tribute to Nikola Tesla — the man who saw the future" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.tribute-altar').style.display='none'">
      </div>
      <figcaption>To the man who saw the future — and gave it all away, so it could belong to everyone.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="past-tesla-q">
      <div class="tq-369 rv" aria-hidden="true">3 · 6 · 9</div>
      <img class="tq-figure rv" src="/illustrations/369-sacred.jpg" alt="Tesla and the sacred 3·6·9" loading="lazy">
      <blockquote class="rv d1">"If you knew the magnificence of <em>3, 6 and 9</em>, you would have a key to the <em>universe</em>."</blockquote>
      <cite class="rv d2">Nikola Tesla · 1856–1943</cite>
    </div>
    <div class="past-bridge rv"><h2>A century later,<br><em>Solana broke it</em>.</h2><p class="rv d1">65,000 transactions per second. $0.00025 per transaction. The meter J.P. Morgan demanded still doesn't exist here.</p><button class="btn-past rv d2" data-hub>↩ Back to Hub</button></div>
  </div>
  <BuySection />
</div>
